+|---|---|---|
+| macOS | AX (private SkyLight SPIs) | `SLPSPostEventRecordTo` — pid-scoped, no cursor warp |
+| Windows | UIAutomation | `SendInput` + `PostMessage` — no focus steal |
+| Linux | AT-SPI (X11 + Wayland) | XTest (X11) / virtual-keyboard (Wayland) |
 
